{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1830","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Hyperregular Bracket Strings"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"3 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given an integer $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ intervals. The $$$i$$$-th interval is $$$[l_i,r_i]$$$ where $$$1 \\leq l_i \\leq r_i \\leq n$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let us call a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"regular"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" bracket sequence$$$^{\\dagger,\\ddagger}$$$ of length $$$n$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"hyperregular"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if for each $$$i$$$ such that $$$1 \\leq i \\leq k$$$, the substring $$$\\overline{s_{l_i} s_{l_{i}+1} \\ldots s_{r_i}}$$$ is also a regular bracket sequence."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to count the number of hyperregular bracket sequences. Since this number can be really large, you are only required to find it modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^\\dagger$$$ A bracket sequence is a string containing only the characters \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" and \""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$^\\ddagger$$$ A bracket sequence is called regular if one can turn it into a valid math expression by adding characters "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"+"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"1"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". For example, sequences "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(())()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()(()))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the empty string are regular, while "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":")("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()))("}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are not."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line of input contains a single integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of test cases. The description of test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$0 \\le k \\le 3 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of the hyperregular bracket sequences and the number of intervals respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$k$$$ lines of each test case contains two integers $$$l_i$$$ and $$$r_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le n$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$3 \\cdot 10^5$$$ and the sum of $$$k$$$ across all test cases does not exceed $$$3 \\cdot 10^5$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the number of hyperregular bracket sequences modulo $$$998\\,244\\,353$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n7\n6 0\n5 0\n8 1\n1 3\n10 2\n3 4\n6 9\n1000 3\n100 701\n200 801\n300 901\n28 5\n1 12\n3 20\n11 14\n4 9\n18 19\n4 3\n1 4\n1 4\n1 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n0\n0\n4\n839415253\n140\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the first testcase, the $$$5$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"hyperregular bracket strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length $$$6$$$ are: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"((()))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(()())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"(())()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()(())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()()()"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the second testcase, there are no regular bracket strings of length $$$5$$$, and consequently, there are no "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"hyperregular bracket strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" of length $$$5$$$."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the third testcase, there are no hyperregular bracket strings of length $$$8$$$ for which the substring $$$[1 \\ldots 3]$$$ is a regular bracket string."}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" For the fourth testcase, there $$$4$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"hyperregular bracket strings"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are: "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"((())(()))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"((())()())"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()()((()))"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"()()(()())"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1830C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1830/problem/C"}